      "funding_type": "rental assistance",
      "typical_award_size": "AHACV operates PBV units at multiple properties (site-based waiting lists for Oak Creek Senior Villas in Thousand Oaks and others; most PBV lists closed) and has committed PBVs to new developments (8 PBVs at Citrus Flats per the County Action Plan; 15-plus at Mountain View Apartments, Fillmore). No current PBV request for proposals was posted on ahacv.org as of November 2026 and the agency's Section 8 Administrative Plan chapter on PBV selection was not opened this pass.",
      "per_unit_cap": "Program cap 20% of ACC units plus excepted units per 24 CFR 983.",
      "affordability_requirement": "PBV households at or below 50% AMI (75% extremely low income) selected from AHACV waiting lists or Coordinated Entry.",
      "eligible_project_types": [
